---

<section id="about" class="section about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>About</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-card">
      <p class="placeholder">
        Hello! I'm a first-year undergraduate student at Yale currently pursing a degree in Computer Science and Mathematics. I'm deeply interested in creative problem-solving and mathematical methods. Previously, I engaged with Transformer machine learning research, olympiad physics, and competitive mathematics.
      </p>
      <ul class="facts">
        <li>
          <span>Location</span>
          <strong>New Haven, CT</strong>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>Focus</span>
          <strong>Interested in Computer Science, Mathematics, and Physics </strong>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>Currently</span>
          <strong>Exploring further topics in machine learning and quantum mechanics</strong>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--off-white);
  }

  .about-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .facts {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .facts span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .facts {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
